\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15476431\charrsid12804902 \'ecnh h\'ecnh hi\u7879\'3fn tr\u7841\'3fng v\'e0 d\u7921\'3f b\'e1o ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn c\'e1c m\u7863\'3ft kinh t\u7871\'3f, x\'e3 h\u7897\'3fi, ki\u7871\'3fn tr\'fac, k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft v.v...

\par -Thi\u7871\'3ft k\u7871\'3f quy ho\u7841\'3fch x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng bao g\u7891\'3fm:
\par +Quy ho\u7841\'3fch x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp: quy ho\u7841\'3fch v\'f9}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15476431\charrsid12804902 ng (v\'f9ng li\'ean t\u7881\'3fnh, v\'f9ng t\u7881\'3fnh, v\'f9ng ngo\u7841
