\'3f chi ph\'ed \'f0\u7875\'3f ho\'e0n th\'e0nh \'f0\u7891\'3f \'e1n quy ho\u7841\'3fch x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng. Ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn cho c\'f4ng t\'e1c quy ho\u7841\'3fch x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3f
c \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo b\u7857\'3fng kinh ph\'ed s\u7921\'3f nghi\u7879\'3fp kinh t\u7871\'3f.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15476431\charrsid12804902 5. Tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp, c\'e1c ng\'e0nh trong vi\u7879\'3fc qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd c\'f4ng t\'e1c quy ho\u7841\'3fch x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng.

\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15476431\charrsid12804902 a) Ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn quy ho\u7841\'3fch l\'e0 c\'f5 quan tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm v\u7873\'3f k\u7871\'3ft qu\u7843\'3f
