\'3fch x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng t\u7893\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp v\'e0 c\'e1c quy ho\u7841\'3fch x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng chuy\'ean ng\'e0nh do \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15476431\charrsid12804902 
\'fd.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af382 \ltrch\fcs0 \f382\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15476431\charrsid12804902 b) Ch\u7911\'3f quy ho\u7841\'3fch: do ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn quy ho\u7841\'3fch quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, ch\u7911\'3f quy ho\u7841\'3fch ch\u7883\'3fu tr\'e1
ch nhi\u7879\'3fm tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn quy ho\u7841\'3fch v\'e0 Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn to\'e0n di\u7879\'3fn k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch c\'f4ng t\'e1c quy ho\u7841\'3fch x\'e2
y d\u7921\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc giao.
