\par K\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v\u7889\'3fn c\'f4ng t\'e1c quy ho\u7841\'3fch x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc l\u7853\'3fp h\'e0ng n\'e3m c\'f9ng v\u7899\'3fi k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch quy ho\u7841\'3fch c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc. C\'f5
