\'f5ng \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3fo) c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm c\u7845\'3fp v\u7889\'3fn \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f, k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi cho c\'f5 quan ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn quy ho\u7841\'3fch x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng tr\'ean c\'f5 s\u7903
