\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid15476431\charrsid12804902 -C\'f4ng t\'e1c kh\u7843\'3fo s\'e1t k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft: 20% d\u7921\'3f to\'e1n.
